{"seq":1,"slug":"aql-standard-inspection-level","title":"AQL 标准与检验水平模型：ISO 2859-1 与 GB/T 2828.1","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/preshipment-inspection-psl-aql/aql-sampling-plan/aql-standard-inspection-level","wordCount":3254,"readingTime":14,"html":"<h1 id=\"aql-标准与检验水平模型-iso-2859-1-与-gb-t-2828-1\">AQL 标准与检验水平模型：ISO 2859-1 与 GB/T 2828.1</h1><p>一份出货前检验（PSI）报告上最不起眼、却决定整批货命运的三行字是：「批量 3500 件 / 检验水平 II / AQL 2.5（主要缺陷）」——它背后是一台查表机器：给定批量查出<strong>样本量字码</strong>，再由字码与 AQL 查出<strong>样本量</strong>与<strong>接收数（Ac）/ 拒收数（Re）</strong>。检验员抽 200 件逐一检查，主要缺陷不超过 10 个就放行，第 11 个判退。这不是某家检验公司的内部习惯，而是 ISO 2859-1 与中国的等同标准 GB/T 2828.1 定义的<strong>可复现算法</strong>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p><strong>AQL（Acceptance Quality Limit，接收质量限）</strong> 的定义是&quot;仍被视为可接受的最差过程平均质量水平&quot;，以百分比或比率表示（<a href=\"https://www.iso.org/standard/28971.html\">ISO 2859-1</a>）。措辞是&quot;最差仍可接受&quot;，不是&quot;目标值&quot;，更不是&quot;保证值&quot;。2008 年 ANSI/ASQ 把英文全称从 acceptable quality limit 改为 acceptance quality level，含义未变（<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Acceptable_quality_limit\">ANSI/ASQ Z1.4-2008</a>）。跨国买家常为三种缺陷类别各约定一个 AQL：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>缺陷类别</th>\n<th>判定标准</th>\n<th>典型 AQL（高价值）</th>\n<th>典型 AQL（中低价值）</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>关键缺陷 Critical</td>\n<td>危及人身安全或违反强制性法规</td>\n<td>0（不允许）</td>\n<td>0（不允许）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>主要缺陷 Major</td>\n<td>可能导致失效、降低适销性或可用性</td>\n<td>1.0 / 1.5</td>\n<td>2.5</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>次要缺陷 Minor</td>\n<td>不影响使用与销售的外观/工艺瑕疵</td>\n<td>2.5 / 4.0</td>\n<td>4.0</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>（分档见第三方检验机构 <a href=\"https://www.v-trust.com/en/our-services/inspection-standards/aql-table\">V-Trust 的 AQL 说明</a>。）关键缺陷写&quot;0&quot;是一个现实约束：标准表没有 AQL=0 的列，零容忍要么靠最小列 0.065 加巨大样本量逼近，要么改用专门的 <strong>c=0 抽样方案</strong>——后文再讲。</p>\n<p>一套 AQL 方案由四个参数成组定义：<strong>批量 N</strong>、<strong>检验水平</strong>、<strong>缺陷分级</strong>、每级对应的 <strong>AQL 数值</strong>。查表是一条单向流水线：<strong>批量与检验水平定字码 → 字码与 AQL 定样本量与 Ac/Re → 实测缺陷数落入接收区或拒收区</strong>。检验水平扮演&quot;油门&quot;：不改变 AQL，只改变抽多少。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  N[批量 N&lt;br/&gt;同型号同批次同交期] --&gt; LV[选定检验水平&lt;br/&gt;一般 I/II/III 或特殊 S-1~S-4]&#10;  LV --&gt; CL[查表 I 得样本量字码 A~R]&#10;  CL --&gt; SZ[查表 II 得样本量 n]&#10;  AQL[约定 AQL&lt;br/&gt;关键/主要/次要 三档] --&gt; PLAN[查表 II 同列相交]&#10;  SZ --&gt; PLAN&#10;  PLAN --&gt; ACR[接收数 Ac / 拒收数 Re]&#10;  ACR --&gt; INSP[实测缺陷数 d]&#10;  INSP --&gt;|d ≤ Ac| ACC[判接收]&#10;  INSP --&gt;|d ≥ Re| REJ[判拒收]&#10;  ACC --&gt; SW{转移规则}&#10;  REJ --&gt; SW&#10;  SW --&gt;|5 批内 2 批拒收| TIGH[转加严检验]&#10;  SW --&gt;|加严下 5 批全接收| NORM[转回正常检验]&#10;  SW --&gt;|10 批全接收且缺陷达标| RED[转放宽检验]\">graph TD\n  N[批量 N&lt;br/&gt;同型号同批次同交期] --&gt; LV[选定检验水平&lt;br/&gt;一般 I/II/III 或特殊 S-1~S-4]\n  LV --&gt; CL[查表 I 得样本量字码 A~R]\n  CL --&gt; SZ[查表 II 得样本量 n]\n  AQL[约定 AQL&lt;br/&gt;关键/主要/次要 三档] --&gt; PLAN[查表 II 同列相交]\n  SZ --&gt; PLAN\n  PLAN --&gt; ACR[接收数 Ac / 拒收数 Re]\n  ACR --&gt; INSP[实测缺陷数 d]\n  INSP --&gt;|d ≤ Ac| ACC[判接收]\n  INSP --&gt;|d ≥ Re| REJ[判拒收]\n  ACC --&gt; SW{转移规则}\n  REJ --&gt; SW\n  SW --&gt;|5 批内 2 批拒收| TIGH[转加严检验]\n  SW --&gt;|加严下 5 批全接收| NORM[转回正常检验]\n  SW --&gt;|10 批全接收且缺陷达标| RED[转放宽检验]</pre><p>链上两个易错点：<strong>批量 N 必须是同一生产批、同规格、同交期</strong>——三条产线尾货拼成一个 N 会让抽样失去统计意义；<strong>AQL 必须写清绑定哪类缺陷</strong>，只写&quot;AQL 2.5&quot;而不说它管关键、主要还是次要，报告事后无法解释。</p>\n<h2 id=\"检验水平模型-一般水平-i-ii-iii-与特殊水平-s-1-s-4\">检验水平模型：一般水平 I/II/III 与特殊水平 S-1~S-4</h2><p>ISO 2859-1 把检验水平分两族。<strong>一般检验水平</strong> I、II、III 决定主检验样本量；<strong>特殊检验水平</strong> S-1 ~ S-4 样本量远小于一般水平，专用于破坏性、耗时或成本极高的项目（<a href=\"https://www.v-trust.com/en/our-services/inspection-standards/aql-table\">V-Trust AQL 表说明</a>）。一般水平判别力固定：<strong>III 比 II 严、I 比 II 松</strong>，同批量样本量按约 1.6 倍一档增减，行业默认取 <strong>II</strong>——合同&quot;检验水平&quot;栏空着就等于 II。下表是标准表 I 的骨架：批量区间与检验水平共同定位样本量字码，同一行里字码沿 I → II → III 右移（更严），沿 S-4 → S-1 左移（更省）。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>批量区间</th>\n<th>水平 I</th>\n<th>水平 II</th>\n<th>水平 III</th>\n<th>S-1</th>\n<th>S-2</th>\n<th>S-3</th>\n<th>S-4</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>2–8</td>\n<td>A</td>\n<td>A</td>\n<td>B</td>\n<td>A</td>\n<td>A</td>\n<td>A</td>\n<td>A</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>9–15</td>\n<td>A</td>\n<td>B</td>\n<td>C</td>\n<td>A</td>\n<td>A</td>\n<td>A</td>\n<td>A</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>16–25</td>\n<td>B</td>\n<td>C</td>\n<td>D</td>\n<td>A</td>\n<td>A</td>\n<td>B</td>\n<td>B</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>26–50</td>\n<td>C</td>\n<td>D</td>\n<td>E</td>\n<td>A</td>\n<td>B</td>\n<td>B</td>\n<td>C</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>51–90</td>\n<td>C</td>\n<td>E</td>\n<td>F</td>\n<td>B</td>\n<td>B</td>\n<td>C</td>\n<td>C</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>91–150</td>\n<td>D</td>\n<td>F</td>\n<td>G</td>\n<td>B</td>\n<td>B</td>\n<td>C</td>\n<td>D</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>151–280</td>\n<td>E</td>\n<td>G</td>\n<td>H</td>\n<td>B</td>\n<td>C</td>\n<td>D</td>\n<td>E</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>281–500</td>\n<td>F</td>\n<td>H</td>\n<td>J</td>\n<td>B</td>\n<td>C</td>\n<td>D</td>\n<td>E</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>501–1200</td>\n<td>G</td>\n<td>J</td>\n<td>K</td>\n<td>C</td>\n<td>C</td>\n<td>E</td>\n<td>F</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>1201–3200</td>\n<td>H</td>\n<td>K</td>\n<td>L</td>\n<td>C</td>\n<td>D</td>\n<td>E</td>\n<td>G</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>3201–10000</td>\n<td>J</td>\n<td>L</td>\n<td>M</td>\n<td>C</td>\n<td>D</td>\n<td>F</td>\n<td>G</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>10001–35000</td>\n<td>K</td>\n<td>M</td>\n<td>N</td>\n<td>C</td>\n<td>D</td>\n<td>F</td>\n<td>H</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>35001–150000</td>\n<td>L</td>\n<td>N</td>\n<td>P</td>\n<td>D</td>\n<td>E</td>\n<td>G</td>\n<td>J</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>150001–500000</td>\n<td>M</td>\n<td>P</td>\n<td>Q</td>\n<td>D</td>\n<td>E</td>\n<td>G</td>\n<td>J</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>500001 及以上</td>\n<td>N</td>\n<td>Q</td>\n<td>R</td>\n<td>D</td>\n<td>E</td>\n<td>H</td>\n<td>K</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>字码共 15 个（A–R，跳过易与 0/1 混淆的 I、O），对应样本量 2、3、5、8、13、20、32、50、80、125、200、315、500、800、1250、2000——近似公比 1.6 的几何级数，使&quot;样本量翻一档&quot;与&quot;判别力变化一档&quot;成正比。</p>\n<p>水平选错双向吃亏。<strong>用 I 代替 II</strong>：样本量砍到约 40%，更易&quot;抽不出&quot;缺陷而误判接收，买方风险变大。<strong>用 III 代替 II</strong>：样本量涨到约 2.5 倍，判别力更强，代价是成本与工时。<strong>特殊水平不能用于主判定</strong>：S-4 在 3500 件批量下只给 G 字码（n=32），拿它判主要缺陷等于放弃统计能力；它的正确用途是破坏性项目（&quot;还要做一次高温老化，抽 3 件即可&quot;）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"样本量字码与抽样方案-从批量到-ac-re\">样本量字码与抽样方案：从批量到 Ac/Re</h2><p>字码落表后与 AQL 列相交得到 <strong>Ac</strong> 与 <strong>Re</strong>。判定只有一句——样本中该类缺陷的实测数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo>≤</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>c</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d \\le Ac</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8304em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span></span></span></span></span> 则接收该批，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo>≥</mo><mi>R</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d \\ge Re</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8304em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span></span></span></span></span> 则拒收该批。正常检验一次抽样表里 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><mi>e</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>c</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Re = Ac + 1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> 恒成立（二次、多次抽样表不满足）。下表摘录常用字码在 AQL 0.65 / 1.0 / 1.5 / 2.5 / 4.0 上的 Ac / Re：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>字码</th>\n<th>样本量 n</th>\n<th>AQL 0.65</th>\n<th>AQL 1.0</th>\n<th>AQL 1.5</th>\n<th>AQL 2.5</th>\n<th>AQL 4.0</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>H</td>\n<td>50</td>\n<td>1 / 2</td>\n<td>1 / 2</td>\n<td>2 / 3</td>\n<td>3 / 4</td>\n<td>5 / 6</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>J</td>\n<td>80</td>\n<td>2 / 3</td>\n<td>2 / 3</td>\n<td>3 / 4</td>\n<td>5 / 6</td>\n<td>7 / 8</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>K</td>\n<td>125</td>\n<td>2 / 3</td>\n<td>3 / 4</td>\n<td>5 / 6</td>\n<td>7 / 8</td>\n<td>10 / 11</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>L</td>\n<td>200</td>\n<td>3 / 4</td>\n<td>5 / 6</td>\n<td>7 / 8</td>\n<td>10 / 11</td>\n<td>14 / 15</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>M</td>\n<td>315</td>\n<td>5 / 6</td>\n<td>7 / 8</td>\n<td>10 / 11</td>\n<td>14 / 15</td>\n<td>21 / 22</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>N</td>\n<td>500</td>\n<td>7 / 8</td>\n<td>10 / 11</td>\n<td>14 / 15</td>\n<td>21 / 22</td>\n<td>21 / 22</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>把开头的例子走一遍：批量 3500 件落在 3201–10000 区间，水平 II → 字码 <strong>L</strong> → 样本量 <strong>n = 200</strong>；主要缺陷 AQL 2.5 → <strong>Ac = 10、Re = 11</strong>，与第三方机构公开的示例一致（<a href=\"https://www.v-trust.com/en/our-services/inspection-standards/aql-table\">V-Trust：3500 件 / 水平 II / AQL 2.5 → 样本 200、接收数 10</a>）。</p>\n<p>两个陷阱必须知道。第一，<strong>Ac 与 Re 不适用于所有列</strong>：当某 AQL 列在某字码行上没有能满足判别力的接收数时，表中出现向下箭头，规则是&quot;改用箭头所指的第一个抽样方案&quot;（换样本量更大的字码），而不是自己补一个数。第二，<strong>n 与批量 N 不是线性关系</strong>：N 从 1200 涨到 3500，n 仅从 125 涨到 200；N 从 35000 涨到 150000，n 仅从 500 涨到 800——<strong>检验成本随批量亚线性增长，买方风险基本不随批量上升</strong>。</p>\n<p>关键缺陷的&quot;零容忍&quot;是这张表最硬的边界。标准表最小列是 0.65，而 0.65 在 n = 200 时 Ac 仍有 3，&quot;允许 3 个关键缺陷&quot;直接违反买方零容忍条款。三条解法：关键缺陷单列并用 AQL 0.065（n 需很大才给 Ac=0）；改用 <strong>c=0 抽样方案</strong>（&quot;抽 n 件，出现 1 件即拒收&quot;，不依赖 AQL 列）；或规定关键缺陷逐件全检该特性。选哪一种要在检验预约阶段写进 <strong>SI（检验规范）</strong>——AQL 表本身不回答&quot;该不该抽、什么时候抽&quot;，那是 <a href=\"../psi-timing-stage/inspection-type-timing-model\">检验类型与时点决策</a> 的范围。</p>\n<p><strong>标准谱系。</strong> 今天所有 AQL 表都是同一份 1950 年代美军标准的后代：MIL-STD-105 于 1995 年 2 月被正式取消，通知把采购方指向 MIL-STD-1916 或 ANSI/ASQ Z1.4（<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/MIL-STD-105\">Wikipedia: MIL-STD-105</a>）。三条支线表体数值基本同源：<strong>ANSI/ASQ Z1.4-2008</strong>（北美合同最常引用）、<strong>ISO 2859-1:1999</strong>（国际通行版）、以及中国的 <strong>GB/T 2828.1-2012《计数抽样检验程序 第1部分：按接收质量限（AQL）检索的逐批检验抽样计划》</strong>，后者<strong>等同采用（IDT）ISO 2859-1:1999</strong>，代替 GB/T 2828-1987（<a href=\"https://std.samr.gov.cn/\">标准信息</a>）。因此<strong>同一批货用 Z1.4 查还是用 GB/T 2828.1 查，样本量与 Ac/Re 通常一致</strong>。ISO 2859 系列另有<strong>第 2 部分</strong>（孤立批，按<strong>极限质量 LQ</strong> 检索）、<strong>第 3 部分</strong>跳批检验、<strong>第 4 部分</strong>声称质量水平评定、<strong>第 5 部分</strong>序贯抽样。</p>\n<h2 id=\"转移规则-正常-加严-放宽与停止检验\">转移规则：正常、加严、放宽与停止检验</h2><p>只学一次抽样表会漏掉 ISO 2859-1 的另一半：它是一套<strong>按历史业绩自动调节检验强度</strong>的闭环，而不只是&quot;每批独立查表&quot;。三种检验状态的转移条件由标准明文规定（<a href=\"https://www.iso.org/standard/28971.html\">ISO 2859-1</a>）：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>起始状态</th>\n<th>转移条件</th>\n<th>目标状态</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>正常检验</td>\n<td>连续 5 批中有 2 批被拒收</td>\n<td>加严检验</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>加严检验</td>\n<td>连续 5 批全部被接收</td>\n<td>正常检验</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>正常检验</td>\n<td>连续 10 批被接收，缺陷总数不超放宽限值，生产稳定，负责方认为放宽可取</td>\n<td>放宽检验</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>放宽检验</td>\n<td>出现 1 批拒收，或生产不稳定/延迟</td>\n<td>正常检验</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>加严检验</td>\n<td>累计 5 批仍未被接收</td>\n<td>停止按本标准检验</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>加严不是&quot;惩罚&quot;，而是提高判别力的自动动作</strong>：样本量不变，但同字码行的 Ac 变小（字码 L 在 AQL 2.5 下正常 Ac=10，加严降到一档更小），同样的产线质量更易被拒收，形成对供应商的负反馈。放宽相反，样本量向下跳约 40%，是质量稳定期给供应商的&quot;奖励&quot;。<strong>停止检验</strong>是保护机制：加严下连续 5 批仍不达标，继续按同一 AQL 抽样已无意义，应暂停收货、回到供应商改进。转移规则按<strong>同一供应商、同一产品、同一 AQL</strong> 的连续批序列记账，且要求有一个持续台账——这对跨境业务恰是最难的一环，卖家常在不同订单上委托不同机构，各机构只看到自己经手的几批。</p>\n<h2 id=\"oc-曲线-为什么-aql-不是-不良率保证\">OC 曲线：为什么 AQL 不是&quot;不良率保证&quot;</h2><p>AQL 最易被误解之处是把它当成&quot;保证不良率不超过 X%&quot;。它真正的含义要看<strong>接收概率曲线（OC 曲线）</strong>：给定抽样方案 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>c</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(n, c)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，当批的真实不良率为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span></span></span></span> 时，该批被接收的概率是</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mi>a</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><munderover><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><mi>c</mi></munderover><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mfrac linethickness=\"0px\"><mi>n</mi><mi>d</mi></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><msup><mi>p</mi><mi>d</mi></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>p</mi><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>d</mi></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P_a(p) = \\sum_{d=0}^{c} \\binom{n}{d} p^{d} (1-p)^{n-d}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.9535em;vertical-align:-1.3021em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.6514em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8479em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.3em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3021em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">(</span></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.1076em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">)</span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8991em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1491em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8991em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>当 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 远小于批量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 时可用泊松近似 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mi>a</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>≈</mo><msubsup><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><mi>c</mi></msubsup><mfrac><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mi>p</mi><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi>d</mi></msup></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">!</mo></mrow></mfrac><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>n</mi><mi>p</mi></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P_a(p) \\approx \\sum_{d=0}^{c} \\frac{(np)^d}{d!} e^{-np}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.4789em;vertical-align:-0.345em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8043em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2029em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2997em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.1339em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mclose mtight\">!</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.485em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mopen mtight\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mclose mtight\"><span class=\"mclose mtight\">)</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.927em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.931em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.345em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7713em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>（<a href=\"https://www.itl.nist.gov/div898/handbook/pmc/section2/pmc232.htm\">NIST/SEMATECH 工程统计手册 §6.2.3.2</a>）。曲线单调下降，AQL 只是曲线在某点附近的位置约定：<strong>在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>Q</mi><mi>L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p = AQL</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span></span></span></span> 处，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mi>a</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P_a</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 通常很高（常见 88%–99%），但不等于 1</strong>，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span></span></span></span> 继续上升时 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mi>a</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P_a</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 才快速下降。由此引出两个对称风险量：<strong>生产者风险</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span></span></span></span> 是&quot;质量恰等于 AQL 的好批却被拒收&quot;的概率，<strong>消费者风险</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>β</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\beta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span></span></span></span></span> 是&quot;质量差到不可接受水平 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>（LTPD / RQL）的批却被接收&quot;的概率。样本量越大，曲线越陡，灰色带越窄，检验成本越高。<strong>平均检出质量上限</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>O</mi><mi>Q</mi><mo>≈</mo><msub><mi>P</mi><mi>a</mi></msub><mi>p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">AOQ \\approx P_a p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span></span></span></span>（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo>≫</mo><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N \\gg n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7224em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≫</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span>）回答&quot;长期看通过检验的货平均还带多少不良&quot;；<strong>平均总检验数</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>T</mi><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>P</mi><mi>a</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>N</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">ATI = n + (1 - P_a)(N - n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 给出&quot;每批平均要检查多少件&quot;——被拒收批通常要整批全检，第二项就是这笔追加成本。</p>\n<p>三个直接结论。<strong>第一，AQL 2.5 不等于&quot;不良率 ≤ 2.5%&quot;</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2.5</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p = 2.5\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2.5%</span></span></span></span></span> 时样本仍约有 5%–12% 概率拒收好批，同时也存在真实不良率 5% 却仍被接收的批——这是抽样检验固有的概率性误判，不能靠&quot;更认真检验&quot;消除。<strong>第二，退货率低的买方也可能在承受它</strong>，因为 OC 曲线只在批量维度上控制风险。<strong>第三，要降低漏放风险只能加严或加量</strong>：调低 AQL、升到水平 III、或从正常转加严，都在同一张表上实现。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>AQL 是查表算法的输入，不是质量承诺</strong>：它定义&quot;最差仍可接受的过程平均&quot;，接收与否由 OC 曲线上的概率决定，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>Q</mi><mi>L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p = AQL</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span></span></span></span> 时仍有可观概率被拒收。</li>\n<li><strong>三件事成组出现才算完整约定</strong>：标准编号（ISO 2859-1 / ANSI Z1.4 / GB/T 2828.1）、检验水平（一般 I/II/III，默认 II）、以及分缺陷类别的 AQL 数值（关键 0 / 主要 1.0–2.5 / 次要 2.5–4.0）。缺任何一项，报告事后都不可解释。</li>\n<li><strong>查表三步不可跳</strong>：批量 + 检验水平 → 样本量字码（A–R）；字码 + AQL → 样本量 n 与 Ac/Re；实测缺陷数落入接收区或拒收区。检验水平是油门不是开关，特殊水平 S-1~S-4 只能用于破坏性/高成本项目。</li>\n<li><strong>三个标准数值同源</strong>：GB/T 2828.1-2012 等同采用 ISO 2859-1:1999，ANSI/ASQ Z1.4-2008 与 MIL-STD-105 同宗；差异来自版本与约定，而非标准本身。</li>\n<li><strong>转移规则是闭环的另一半</strong>：正常 ⇄ 加严（5 批内 2 批拒收则加严，加严下 5 批全收则回正常）、正常 → 放宽（10 批全收且缺陷达标）、加严下累计 5 批不达标则<strong>停止检验</strong>。它要求按&quot;同供应商、同产品、同 AQL&quot;维护连续批台账。</li>\n<li><strong>关键缺陷的零容忍与 AQL 表存在天然冲突</strong>：标准表最小列是 0.65，做不到 Ac=0；要么单列 0.065、要么改用 c=0 方案、要么全检该特性。</li>\n<li>本文只处理&quot;AQL 表怎么查、怎么解释&quot;；抽样方案定下之后的动作见 <a href=\"../psi-timing-stage/inspection-type-timing-model\">检验类型与时点决策</a> 与 <a href=\"../psi-timing-stage/inspection-booking-lead-time-window\">检验预约的交期窗口</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"AQL 标准与检验水平模型：ISO 2859-1 与 GB/T 2828.1","id":"aql-标准与检验水平模型-iso-2859-1-与-gb-t-2828-1"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"检验水平模型：一般水平 I/II/III 与特殊水平 S-1~S-4","id":"检验水平模型-一般水平-i-ii-iii-与特殊水平-s-1-s-4"},{"level":2,"text":"样本量字码与抽样方案：从批量到 Ac/Re","id":"样本量字码与抽样方案-从批量到-ac-re"},{"level":2,"text":"转移规则：正常、加严、放宽与停止检验","id":"转移规则-正常-加严-放宽与停止检验"},{"level":2,"text":"OC 曲线：为什么 AQL 不是\"不良率保证\"","id":"oc-曲线-为什么-aql-不是-不良率保证"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"现场验货改期、中止与供应商违约的时机异常处置","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/preshipment-inspection-psl-aql/psi-timing-stage/onsite-reschedule-abort-exception"},"next":{"title":"抽样方案机制：批量、样本量与 Ac/Re 判定计算","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/preshipment-inspection-psl-aql/aql-sampling-plan/sampling-plan-ac-re-calculation"}}